//   - Cannot retain bytes when algorithm family incompatible (RSA → ECDSA)
//   - Cannot retain bytes for different scopes requiring different key structures
//
// Example 1: Transform to higher security
//
//	TransformKeyRequest {
//	  name: "legacy-signing-key"
//	  retain_key_bytes: false
//	  scope_spec: {
//	    signature: {
//	      scope: SIGNATURE_SCOPE_STANDARD,
//	      security: { security_strength_bits: 256, quantum_safe: true }
//	    }
//	  }
//	}
//	→ Current policy allows: [ecdsa-p256-sha256, ml-dsa-65, ml-dsa-87]
//	→ Filter by security_strength_bits=256, quantum_safe=true
//	→ Select ml-dsa-87 (highest security)
//
// Example 2: Transform for performance (explicit template)
